{"ID":"20240205164741-wflpjy6","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205164741-wflpjy6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164741-wflpjy6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172344-gskcri8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616083351-aytydq8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619182449-jhlvev4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"025术（白术、苍术、白朮、苍朮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240912163913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205172344-gskcri8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172344-gskcri8","updated":"20240205172356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【產地】\t主產浙江、湖南、湖北、安徽等地。\n【性狀】\t根莖呈拳形團塊，長313cm，直徑1.57cm。表面灰黃色或灰棕色，有瘤狀突起及斷續的縱皺紋和鬚根痕，頂端有殘留莖基和芽痕。質堅硬，不易折斷，斷面不平坦，黃白色至淡棕色，有棕黃色的點狀油室散在。氣清香，味甘、微辛，嚼之略帶粘性。\n【性味】\t苦、甘，溫。\n【功效】\t健脾益氣、燥濕利水、止汗、安胎。用於脾虛食少、腹脹泄瀉、痰飲眩悸、水腫、自汗、胎動不安。\n【注解】\t“如意頭”：指白朮全體有多個瘤狀突起，根莖下部兩側膨大的部分，形似如意之頭。\n“鶴頂”：白朮根莖的形狀類似仙鶴，有時還帶有地上部分的殘莖，像仙鶴的脖頸。也有因為白朮的木質狀莖如腿形，而稱為“白朮腿”。"}]},{"ID":"20240205172339-rifw4u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172339-rifw4u9","updated":"20240205172339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172339-mnbtyy3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165534-dibyul8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165534-dibyul8","updated":"20240205165534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白术"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白术-20240205165534-zrzq9ns.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240618114734-91cudh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618114734-91cudh9","updated":"20240801150424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618114734-gsfef9f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 407px;","style":"width: 397px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白术 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白术 6-20240801150410-9etmlfb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 397px;\" parent-style=\"width: 407px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240801150017-jv9ei8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240801150017-jv9ei8m","updated":"20240801150246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 537px;","style":"width: 527px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240801150017-boqlnu0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 527px;\" parent-style=\"width: 537px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 708px;","style":"width: 698px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白术"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白术-20240801144905-u5l3l4m.jpg"}